      "uid": "zhcn:2341dde0de1adc8455b99714",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "舍弃永恒的安宁，为绽放刹那的光辉而赌上性命。\n这就是我所能被允许的，唯一的权利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbf9865ea2f94f383f7e1ea40dae433bbf7b0b6fbf78c34bf3def9138310a19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
